# RabbitMQ management UI on trefry.net. Mirrors the mqapps.trefry.net site block in
# /etc/caddy/Caddyfile on the host (already live; DNS and TLS verified 2026-10-12).
# Caddy adds TLS only. RabbitMQ's own admin login still protects the UI. AMQP (5672) is not
# proxied. See infra/shared/README.md, "Remote management UI".
mqapps.trefry.net {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:15672
}
